    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Circuitborn (Parallax Line)</em> at level 11; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“Locks are polite requests.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Ghost-In-The-Wires (1/a Soma Break).</strong> For 10 minutes, you can interface with nearby mechanisms and simple electronics at 30 feet (doors, lights, locks, speakers). This is not mind control; it’s remote sabotage and mischief.</p>",
